<title>USA: West Perry School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>West Perry School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The West Perry School District, Pa., said Monday it recalculated Mellon Bank's winning bid on the District's $6.125 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 4.711 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 4.682 percent originally calculated.</p>
